Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.01,0:00:01.30,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Llevas años sintiéndote poco
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.30,0:00:02.27,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}por estas 10 cosas
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.27,0:00:03.02,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Dices que sí a todo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.02,0:00:04.00,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}para que nadie se enfade
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:04.44,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}contigo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.44,0:00:05.32,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Te comparas con la vida
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.32,0:00:06.22,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que los demás enseñan
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.22,0:00:07.23,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}por redes y que sabes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.23,0:00:07.73,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que es falsa
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.73,0:00:08.86,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Te prometes cosas que luego
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.86,0:00:09.57,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}no cumples
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.57,0:00:10.39,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Necesitas que alguien
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.39,0:00:11.30,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}te valide para sentir
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.30,0:00:11.86,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que vales
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.86,0:00:12.52,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Tapas lo que sientes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.52,0:00:13.11,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}con el móvil
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.11,0:00:13.75,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}con la fiesta
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.75,0:00:14.67,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}con los videojuegos
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.67,0:00:15.26,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}o con el alcohol
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.26,0:00:16.58,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Consumes cada día justo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.58,0:00:17.07,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}lo que te baja
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.07,0:00:17.57,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}la energía
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.57,0:00:18.71,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Hablas desde la queja todo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.71,0:00:19.46,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}el puto día
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.46,0:00:20.11,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Te rodeas de gente
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.11,0:00:20.75,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que te resta
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.75,0:00:21.55,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y que no tiene ambición
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.55,0:00:22.35,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Nunca te paras a estar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.35,0:00:23.20,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}en silencio y a escuchar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.20,0:00:24.07,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}lo que sientes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.07,0:00:24.92,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Y vives en tu cabeza
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.92,0:00:26.20,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}pensando sin parar y nunca
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.20,0:00:27.04,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}te has parado a mirar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.04,0:00:28.16,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de dónde viene todo eso
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.16,0:00:28.92,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que es de lo que viviste
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.92,0:00:29.45,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de pequeño
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.45,0:00:30.04,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Así que no te hace
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.04,0:00:30.69,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}falta quererte
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.69,0:00:31.13,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}te sobra todo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.13,0:00:32.30,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}lo que te quita energía
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.30,0:00:33.04,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Empieza por una
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.04,0:00:33.52,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}la que más te ha
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.52,0:00:34.52,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}dolido escucharla
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.52,0:00:35.59,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y verás cómo cambia todo
